# Armasaur Guide: "Whenever you attack with three or more creatures, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control" (CR 508.1,
# 603.2, 122.1). On turn 3 Bot1 attacks with the Guide, Memnite and Ornithopter (three): the trigger takes a target, refusing
# Bot2's Memnite (it is not Bot1's creature), and Bot1 chooses Memnite, which gets the counter (2/2) in time to connect. The Guide has
# vigilance, so it stays untapped while the Memnite and Ornithopter tap. Combat damage: 4 + 2 + 0 = 6, Bot2 20 to 14.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Armasaur Guide
Memnite
Ornithopter
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x10

